WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.370
The announcement was a long time coming, if
you believe the rumor mill: The US has officially

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:08.150
accused Chinese telecom giant Huawei of a
bevy of crimes.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:13.870
A grand jury in New York has returning indictment
alleging 13 additional crimes committed by

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:20.470
Huawei, it's CFO, its affiliate in Iran and
one of its subsidiaries here in the United

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:21.630
States.

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:26.750
The criminal activity alleged in this indictment
goes back at least ten years and goes all

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:30.210
the way to the top of the company."

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:34.090
The US justice department accuses Huawei's
top brass of using a Hong Kong based shell

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:40.270
company to funnel telecommunications equipment
to Iran in violation of international sanctions.

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:44.290
Investigators also accuse Huawei's engineers
of stealing trade secrets from cell phone

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:51.050
provider T-Mobile, including robotics plans
used in T-Mobile's cellphone testing.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:55.770
The US' is also seeking the extradition of
Huawei CFO MENG WANZHOU for her roll in the

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:57.770
alleged sanction violations.

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:02.240
She was arrested in Canada late last year
in connection with the US' investigation.

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:07.810
Huawei has long been suspected of having close
ties to the Chinese government.

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:12.229
A cause for concern for some international
observers.

00:01:12.229 --> 00:01:20.170
However both the company and the Chinese government
deny the accusations.

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:23.990
Just as the foreign ministry said, with no
evidence, they're using their state power

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:27.329
to discredit and attack designated companies.

00:01:27.329 --> 00:01:33.420
This sort of behaviour is unfair and immoral.

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:36.749
The charges are likely to throw a fresh spanner
in the works.

00:01:36.749 --> 00:03:15.680
Washington and Beijing are set to reopen

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:31.299
trade talks

00:03:31.299 --> 00:03:49.920
over

00:03:49.920 --> 00:04:06.040
their simmering

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:17.870
trade

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:48.110
conflict later this week.

